  m_text: 'WASD - Move around

    Mouse - Look around

    Space - Jump

    Left-Shift
    - Sprint

    F - Interact

    Left-Click - Fire current weapon | Click buttons
    if user interface is open

    Right-Click - Aim current weapon

    R - Reload

    B
    - Switch firing mode (if current weapon allows)

    Q - Request air strike at
    where the player is aiming at

    P or Esc - Pause Game/Close interface

    G
    or Tab - Open/Close inventory'
