--- !u!114 &3613247660948504230
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1342898689992739325}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e455bdf3ce136ca4a81ea5f925dc5178, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  charName: Irene Vanderkleij
  firstTimeInteractionName: 
  timesInteractedWith: 0
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: Good afternoon.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Renske
    dialogue: Hi auntie!
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9817088143128f4092e0bb66063a170, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: Heh... you'd be the auntie... About half a millenia worth of great
      aunties...
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Charlie
    dialogue: What's up captain? Anything for us to do right now?
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 812f1a892b8cf294a9b69afdab8a83a1, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: Yes... Ugh... Those bastard mutants are popping up even more.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Charlie
    dialogue: Figured since Aleksey, Luk'yan, Vasilka, and those other mercenary
      kids were redeployed.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 812f1a892b8cf294a9b69afdab8a83a1, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: I understand they have their reasons... But still.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: Anyways... You know the drill for today. Just take out the mutants
      and any suspicious characters in and around New Isselville. Renske, you know
      this village better than all of us. I'm sure you can help direct Charlie.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Renske
    dialogue: Aye-eye captain!
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c9817088143128f4092e0bb66063a170, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: Oh and one more thing. You will need air support.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Irene
    dialogue: Talk to the kid that is next to his plane outside.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faeec3f5252519040a3bcdfecce97634, type: 3}
  isHumanoidOrAnimal: 1
  scriptToActivate: {fileID: 0}
