--- !u!114 &4324992682530041549
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3985304425453171830}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e455bdf3ce136ca4a81ea5f925dc5178, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  charName: Charlie's Laptop
  firstTimeInteractionName: 
  timesInteractedWith: 0
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: 
    dialogue: The screen fills up with the chat history between Charlie and Aleksey.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Aleksey Lijn @VladMakarov
    dialogue: Privyet.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e223d2baa41ebc94393b7e7b202ed5d3, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Charlie Gray @LastBigRed1
    dialogue: You mercenaries and your intimidating accents. I am not an enemy of
      New York and you know it!
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 812f1a892b8cf294a9b69afdab8a83a1, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Charlie @LastBigRed1
    dialogue: Anyways... Ya made it to Staten Island yet?
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 812f1a892b8cf294a9b69afdab8a83a1, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Aleksey @VladMakarov
    dialogue: Da. Just docked at Fort Wadsworth. You sure you'll be fine? I can come
      back if needed, I don't mind smashing more heads if necessary. Can't let New
      York fall to these bastards.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e223d2baa41ebc94393b7e7b202ed5d3, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Charlie @LastBigRed1
    dialogue: Ha! This is child's play compared to what I encountered on those French
      beaches. But I appreciate you and your team's help liberating this damn place.
      At least my baby sister is happy about it and is also grateful.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 812f1a892b8cf294a9b69afdab8a83a1, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Charlie @LastBigRed1
    dialogue: Well, good luck in Staten Island. I'm sure there's bastards over there
      for you to club.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 812f1a892b8cf294a9b69afdab8a83a1, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Aleksey @VladMakarov
    dialogue: Spasibo. Good luck to you too.
    appearOnlyInFirstInteraction: 0
    speakerPFP: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e223d2baa41ebc94393b7e7b202ed5d3, type: 3}
  isHumanoidOrAnimal: 0
  scriptToActivate: {fileID: 0}
